    <forceEntry id="f51f-dbbe-fb51-470c" name="Legion Astartes - White Scars (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="832e-1abf-8160-68d6" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 5. Formation initiative 1+.
3 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
A line or support detachment may choose up to four upgrades; each upgrade only once and only one transport option.
Up to 1/3 of the army's points may be spent on Allies and/or Lords of War.
Cohesive allies: Legio Titanicus, Solar Auxilia, Mechanicum Taghmata, Knight Household, Legio Custodes.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
